{"speciesId":841,"names":{"fr":"Pomdrapi","es":"Flapple","en":"Flapple","ja":"アップリュー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il a évolué après avoir mangé une pomme acide. Il concentre dans ses joues un liquide si corrosif qu’il peut provoquer des brûlures."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Ha evolucionado tras ingerir una manzana ácida. Las bolsas de las mejillas albergan un fluido cuya extrema acidez llega a provocar quemaduras."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It ate a sour apple, and that induced its evolution. In its cheeks, it stores an acid capable of causing chemical burns."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"すっぱい りんごを 食べて 進化。 火傷する ほど 強酸性の 液体を 頬袋に 溜める。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il vole avec ses ailes faites de pelures de pomme et crache une substance très acide. Il peut aussi prendre la forme de ce fruit."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Escupe una saliva sumamente ácida y vuela con sus alas compuestas por piel de manzana, cuyo aspecto es capaz de adoptar."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It flies on wings of apple skin and spits a powerful acid. It can also change its shape into that of an apple."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"りんごの 皮の 翼で 飛んで 強酸性の 唾液を 飛ばす。 りんごの 形に 変形する。"}],"varieties":[{"id":841,"moves":[{"name":"wing-attack","learns":[[20,"level-up",0],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",0]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[20,"level-up",40],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",40],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"leech-seed","learns":[[20,"level-up",12],[25,"level-up",12],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"growth","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"solar-beam","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"withdraw","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name"